  triage:headSha "26ea2806a" ;
  triage:occursIn <urn:atm:triage:worktree/ay8-26ea2806a> ;
  triage:note "quality-mgr qa-pr1280-r3: discovered live during round-3 re-verification, not previously triaged. Fix is either (a) add syn to allowed_dependencies for this dev-only usage, or (b) move the AST-guard logic to a location/crate that already carries syn, or (c) gate the guard behind a workspace-level xtask/tool crate outside atm-herdr's own manifest. Any of these resolves both this finding and completes AY8-QA-005 sub-issue 4 cleanup in the same fix pass." .

